<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CSR plans A$1 bln shakeup - newspaper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CSR plans A$1 bln shakeup - newspaper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building materials and sugar group CSR Ltd is poised to raise more than A$1 billion from a shakeup of its Australian timber and U.S. construction material interests, the Sydney Morning Herald reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the moves would be aimed at restoring profit growth and addressing investor concerns about the company's strategic direction.</p>
